:'''March 7th:''' No, no, no... Gepard is a captain of the Silvermane Guards, just like how the Luofu has its own Cloud Knights captains. I have no idea what he's doing running security at a hotel like this though.
:'''Fu Xuan:''' It isn't so surprising. In attempting to pursue the rational, we piece together the unrelated. The result is a seemingly meaningful fantasy &mdash; a fantasy called life.
:'''Memory-Gepard:''' Excuse me, Miss March. Do you need anything? If there's nothing else, please let me get back to my duty.
:'''Memory-Gepard:''' Also, allow me to remind you &mdash; you cannot change the past. The future is all that's left for you.
:'''March 7th:''' Hmm, that actually does feels like something he would say...
