===Interact with the "abnormality" and rewind to an older memory{{subst:void|<!--202050306-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Memory-Belobog|update|March 7th really doesn't think "a monitor from the Herta Space Station" can represent the entire station. She surmises that this item appeared here only because the station is positively covered by monitors of the same model and build... Their overwhelming presence had stamped themselves indelibly into her memory.<br />"But that's not half bad," she thought. "The only other memorable thing I have from there is the Doomsday Beast... Thank goodness it's the monitors that showed up!"}}
